{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-7-e27","title":"钟毓以四年冬薨会未知问","order":5819,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-7-e27","label":"正文 · 景元四年 · 四年冬","text":"钟毓以四年冬薨会未知问","evidence":["wgc-q0505","wgc-q0082"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0093","role":"以四年冬薨","evidence":["wgc-q0505","wgc-q0082"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"景元四年 · 四年冬","precision":"year","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0505","wgc-q0082","wgc-q0506"],"year":263,"chronology":"wgc-y-7-e27","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wgc-q0082","basis":"逐项对读原行动及直接释年注，保留原季月，不沿用后续迁官。"}},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0505"}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0093","name":"钟毓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0082","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-bab760e79c090fdc0e1d","layer":"original","quote":"会兄毓，以四年冬薨〖1〗；会竟未知问〖2〗。会兄子邕，随会与俱死。会所养兄子毅及峻、辿﹝一﹞等下狱，当伏诛。司马文王表天子下诏曰：“峻等祖父繇，三祖之世，极位台司〖3〗；佐命立勋，飨食庙庭〖4〗。父毓，历职内外，干事有绩。昔楚思子文之治〖5〗，不灭鬭氏之祀；晋录成、宣之忠〖6〗，用存赵氏之后。以会、邕之罪，而绝繇、毓之类，吾有愍然！峻、辿兄弟特原，有官爵者如故。惟毅及邕息伏法〖7〗。”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":595,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":194},{"id":"wgc-q0505","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-bab760e79c090fdc0e1d","layer":"original","quote":"会兄毓，以四年冬薨〖1〗；会竟未知问","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":595,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18},{"id":"wgc-q0506","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-21f27cd2408644113d0a","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":600,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-da9b61657cd6b6077553","start":0,"end":19}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
